WEBVTT

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:04.350
Inside these companies,
it's not just machines replacing humans.

00:10:04.391 --> 00:10:07.144
It's machines and humans working together,

00:10:07.144 --> 00:10:08.854
learning from each other.

00:10:09.146 --> 00:10:10.522
And when that happens,

00:10:10.564 --> 00:10:14.026
the organization's overall rate
of learning increases,

00:10:14.068 --> 00:10:16.779
which in turn makes the company
much more agile,

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.072
much more resilient,

00:10:18.113 --> 00:10:20.908
ready to adapt
and take on any challenge.

00:10:21.909 --> 00:10:26.121
It is the human touch
that will bring the best out of AI.

00:10:26.413 --> 00:10:27.581
Thank you.

00:10:27.623 --> 00:10:33.170
(Applause)